flowchart TB
    accTitle: Information production can outgrow human inspection
    accDescr: A wide band of growing records, events, findings and model interpretations narrows through a governed decision context into the limited attention of one accountable Decision Owner.
    P[\"<b>Information production keeps growing</b><br/>records · events · deterministic findings · analytical results · model interpretations"/]:::src
    G["<b>Governed decision context</b><br/>keeps what could change a decision<br/>and shows its source, scope, gaps and owner"]:::pkt
    O(["<b>Decision Owner</b><br/>finite attention · accountable"]):::own
    P -->|"authorize · select · label"| G
    G -->|"one decision packet"| O
